  "title": "AIIMS Madurai set to start 150-bed services in January 2027, MP confirms",
  "summary": "AIIMS Madurai is preparing to launch its first phase with 150 beds in January 2027. The Centre has separately told the Madras High Court that full-fledged outpatient services are expected to begin on January 1.",
