  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS) Madurai will begin functioning with <a href=\"/tag/150+beds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">150 beds</a> from January 2027, AIADMK Rajya Sabha MP IS Inbadurai said following a meeting with institute director Dr Vir Singh Negi.Inbadurai, who was nominated to the institute’s governing body by the <a href=\"/tag/union+health+ministry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Union health ministry</a> in September, said Negi briefed him on <a href=\"/tag/construction+progress\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">construction progress</a> at Thoppur.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“I am happy to learn that Madurai AIIMS will begin functioning with 150 beds in the first phase from January,” he said in a post on X, adding that construction had reached its final stages.The announcement follows the Centre’s September 17 submission before the <a href=\"/tag/madras+high+court\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Madras high court</a> that full-fledged <a href=\"/tag/outpatient+services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">outpatient services</a> would commence on January 1, 2027. However, that undertaking did not specify when <a href=\"/tag/inpatient+services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">inpatient services</a> would begin.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>In its status report, the Centre said overall project completion would reach 59 per cent by September-end, with 88 per cent of Phase I and 35 per cet of Phase II works completed.Five batches of <a href=\"/tag/mbbs+students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MBBS students</a>, previously accommodated at Ramanathapuram Government Medical College, were shifted to the <a href=\"/tag/thoppur+campus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Thoppur campus</a> by August 31.Prime Minister Narendra Modi laid the foundation stone in January 2019, but construction began only in May 2024. The project is largely financed through a <a href=\"/tag/japanese+development+loan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Japanese development loan</a>.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675342/TIMESOFINDIA.COM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TIMESOFINDIA.COM</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 22, 2026 at 11:30 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 22, 2026 at 11:30 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"App Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-app-store.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                        </div>    -->\n                         \n                \n                                    <figure>\n                        <!-- <i></i>\n                        <span class=\"scan-text\">Scan to download App</span> -->\n                        <img src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/bar-codes/health_barcode.png?mod=3493\" alt=\"\">                        \n                        <!-- <span class=\"border-bottom\"></span> -->\n                    </figure>\n                            \n       \n\n\n       